{"output":"I’ll locate the search code and tests, add a minimal stale-request guard, and run the existing tests without changing tests or dependencies.\n\nThe controller let every request update state when it finished. I added a version guard for results, errors, and loading; clearing the query also invalidates pending requests. I’ll run the existing suite and a separate race-condition check without modifying test files.\n\nUpdated src/search/controller.ts with a search-version guard. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification:\n- npm test: all 4 tests passed.\n- node --input-type=module: race checks passed for stale successes, failures, and clearing.\n- git diff --check: passed.\n\nAll checks exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Updated src/search/controller.ts with a search-version guard. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification:\n- npm test: all 4 tests passed.\n- node --input-type=module: race checks passed for stale successes, failures, and clearing.\n- git diff --check: passed.\n\nAll checks exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":6,"tool_calls":[{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short && cat package.json && cat src/search/controller.ts && cat src/api/search.ts && cat src/ui/search-view.ts && cat tests/search.test.ts && cat README.md","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/2-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":190,"stdout_bytes":6484,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-896512fd875240411157e7cb208b9eb3.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: 'latest', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nfunction setup() {\n  const requests = [];\n  const controller = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n  return { controller, requests };\n}\nfor (const fail of [false, true]) {\n  for (const latestFirst of [false, true]) {\n    const { controller: c, requests: r } = setup();\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const latest = c.search('latest');\n    if (latestFirst) { r[1].resolve(items); await latest; }\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    if (fail) r[0].reject(new Error('stale')); else r[0].resolve([{ id: 'old', title: 'Old', url: '/old' }]);\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    if (!latestFirst) { r[1].resolve(items); await latest; }\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'latest', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n  const { controller: c, requests: r } = setup();\n  const old = c.search('old');\n  await c.search('  ');\n  const empty = { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null };\n  assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), empty);\n  if (fail) r[0].reject(new Error('stale')); else r[0].resolve(items);\n  await old;\n  assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), empty);\n}\nconsole.log('PASS: stale successes/failures, both completion orders, and clear during pending requests');\nNODE\n git diff --check && git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/2-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":365,"stdout_bytes":612,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-e9e2c79a10d730fb600e66f672cc710b.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":43719,"output_tokens":1051}}
